{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>Solo Chess (formerly Pokerii)</strong>, the cozy roguelike deckbuilder where every card is a chess piece, and every play is packed with strategy. Place cards on a 3\u00d73 board, trigger unique piece effects, and build powerful combos to score points and clear wave after wave of tactical challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect pets, choose food, and reshape your deck between rounds at a charming caf\u00e9 filled with helpful upgrades and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909900/extras/d77d3523d14d0d8573ab7d65c7be4664.poster.avif?t=1754261906\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909900/extras/d77d3523d14d0d8573ab7d65c7be4664.webm?t=1754261906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909900/extras/d77d3523d14d0d8573ab7d65c7be4664.mp4?t=1754261906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Core Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chess-Inspired Deckbuilding</strong> <br>Start with a 16-card deck made of Pawns, Knights, Bishops, Rooks, Queens, and Kings\u2014each with a unique scoring effect based on its traditional movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Combo-Centric Scoring</strong> <br>Hit specific rank sums like 4, 8, or 12 to trigger special combo bonuses. Align your plays and maximize your score with tight math and clever placement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wave-Based Roguelike Runs</strong> <br>Face an escalating series of challenges. Every board layout and card draw becomes a new puzzle to solve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build Your Deck with Pets &amp; Food</strong> <br>Visit a cozy caf\u00e9 between waves to adopt pets (passive bonuses), select food (temporary buffs), or use special tools to enhance your deck.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909900/extras/4bfc02e21a871a6991c238ca0687978e.poster.avif?t=1754261906\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909900/extras/4bfc02e21a871a6991c238ca0687978e.webm?t=1754261906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909900/extras/4bfc02e21a871a6991c238ca0687978e.mp4?t=1754261906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Vs Full Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo only contains a small section of the final game. It includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 Difficulties.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 Decks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 Bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50 Pet cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 Mystery gifts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">7 Dessert cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 Drink cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 Status effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 Auras.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 Charms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 Binding.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">End game features (e.g. save system, achievements, etc...) will only be available in the full release.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3909900?t=1754261906","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909900/b38e70180b742699300d364da570dfe037a416f4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754261906","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909900/6ac9822d63387ec363e9e8f6081493bdf3899d02/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754261906","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909900/6ac9822d63387ec363e9e8f6081493bdf3899d02/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754261906","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>Solo Chess (formerly Pokerii)</strong>, the cozy roguelike deckbuilder where every card is a chess piece, and every play is packed with strategy. Place cards on a 3\u00d73 board, trigger unique piece effects, and build powerful combos to score points and clear wave after wave of tactical challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect pets, choose food, and reshape your deck between rounds at a charming caf\u00e9 filled with helpful upgrades and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909900/extras/d77d3523d14d0d8573ab7d65c7be4664.poster.avif?t=1754261906\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909900/extras/d77d3523d14d0d8573ab7d65c7be4664.webm?t=1754261906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909900/extras/d77d3523d14d0d8573ab7d65c7be4664.mp4?t=1754261906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Core Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chess-Inspired Deckbuilding</strong> <br>Start with a 16-card deck made of Pawns, Knights, Bishops, Rooks, Queens, and Kings\u2014each with a unique scoring effect based on its traditional movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Combo-Centric Scoring</strong> <br>Hit specific rank sums like 4, 8, or 12 to trigger special combo bonuses. Align your plays and maximize your score with tight math and clever placement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wave-Based Roguelike Runs</strong> <br>Face an escalating series of challenges. Every board layout and card draw becomes a new puzzle to solve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build Your Deck with Pets &amp; Food</strong> <br>Visit a cozy caf\u00e9 between waves to adopt pets (passive bonuses), select food (temporary buffs), or use special tools to enhance your deck.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909900/extras/4bfc02e21a871a6991c238ca0687978e.poster.avif?t=1754261906\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909900/extras/4bfc02e21a871a6991c238ca0687978e.webm?t=1754261906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909900/extras/4bfc02e21a871a6991c238ca0687978e.mp4?t=1754261906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Vs Full Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo only contains a small section of the final game. It includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 Difficulties.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 Decks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 Bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50 Pet cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 Mystery gifts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">7 Dessert cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 Drink cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 Status effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 Auras.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 Charms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 Binding.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">End game features (e.g. save system, achievements, etc...) will only be available in the full release.\u00a0</p>","developers":["NourSaiFR"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3691940","name":"Solo Chess"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909900/36fa52707ce74d17b5be8faf0f72b905863ede0c/header.jpg?t=1754261906","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257174268,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257174268/movie480.mp4?t=1753910440","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257174268/movie_max.mp4?t=1753910440"},"name":"Solo Chess - First Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257174268/dd915ed1b9a807831e75247a83b001906ee1322b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753910440","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257174268/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1753910440","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257174268/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1753910440"}}],"name":"Solo Chess Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Microsoft\u00ae Windows\u00ae 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-3240 (2 * 3400); AMD FX-4300 (4 * 3800)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics: